    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This\r\n\r\n**Expected Behavior:**\r\nClicking the star button should change it from \"Not Saved\" to \"Saved\" and turn the button golden.\r\n---\r\n\r\n1. **Test it:**\r\n   Run the code and click the button once.\r\n   What happens (or doesn’t happen)?\r\n\r\n2. **Check the basics:** Look for small mistakes that can break the connection between the button and the action.\r\n\r\n::: details [View Debugging Checklist]\r\n- **Selector match:** Does the JavaScript selector match the HTML `id` or `class` exactly?\r\n- **Element exists:** Is that element actually on the page?\r\n- **Order:** Are elements selected before they’re used?\r\n- **Event setup:** Is `'click'` spelled right (not `'onclick'`)?\r\n- **Handler:** Does the code actually change the page (text, image, etc.)?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n3. **Ask AI for help:** If you're stuck, describe what's happening and ask:\r\n\r\n   > Why isn't this button working? Here's the error or result: [insert error here]. Explain it in beginner terms and suggest what to check first.\r\n\r\n4. **Fix and verify:** Work with AI to make one precise change If it's still not working, discuss what to try next and keep refining until the feature behaves as expected.",
    "bubble_choice_description": "The star should flip between \"Saved\" and \"Not saved\" when you click it, but it doesn't react at all. Fix it so the star actually changes.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
